 VR IMMERSION\n\nDrive from a first-person cockpit view and experience racing like never before. Look into corners, judge distance, and react instantly with smooth, responsive VR controls.\n\nDYNAMIC WEATHER CONDITIONS\n\nRace in changing environments that transform the driving experience:\n\nSunny \u2013 Clear visibility, perfect racing conditions\nSunset \u2013 Dramatic lighting and intense atmosphere\nRainy \u2013 Wet surfaces that challenge your control and precision\n\nEach condition adds a new layer of difficulty and realism.\n HIGH-SPEED, SKILL-BASED RACING\nPush your car to the limit with:\n\nResponsive handling\nSmooth acceleration and braking\nA strong sense of speed built for VR\n\nMaster the track by improving your racing line and reaction time.\n\n DESIGNED FOR META QUEST\n\nBuilt for performance and comfort:\n\nOptimized VR gameplay\nIntuitive controls\nSmooth and immersive experience\n\nMASTER EVERY CONDITION\nIt\u2019s not just about speed \u2014 it\u2019s about control.\n\nF1 World Circuit Racing: VR Edition \u2014 Adapt to the Track. Dominate the Drive.", "short_description": "High-speed VR Formula racing simulator with dynamic weather. Experience realistic cockpit driving, immersive gameplay, and intense circuit racing on Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gamelooms-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Game Loom", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gamelooms-privacy-policy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb